@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Ghosting: middle and back
Ghosting, middle and back, three minutes. Medium pace. Back corners via the box corner, middle open
or closed. Swing on the beep, and get back to the T for the next call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 @random{fill, no repeats} [medium middle], [medium back]
0:47 Rest. Plant at forty-five degrees at the back.
-0:03 [countdown]
1:02 @random{fill, no repeats} [medium middle], [medium back]
1:48 Rest. Split step on every call.
-0:03 [countdown]
2:03 @random{fill, no repeats} [medium middle], [medium back]
---
[stop]
